        <item>
            <title>0.15.6</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 09:17:45 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>167</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Settings now has a &quot;Recordings folder&quot; row with an Open button that reveals the folder with all your recordings (audio + video) in Finder.</li>
<li>&quot;Screen video recording&quot; moved into General settings, right under Microphone.</li>
<li>The empty Welcome screen no longer shows the header &quot;+&quot; button (it already has its own Start recording button).</li>
<li>The &quot;Catch the start of calls&quot; setting.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
